414	// the CLI happens to be talking to. So:
415	//   - ENTIRE_WEB_BASE_URL wins when set (e.g. http://localhost:5173 for a local
416	//     frontend during dev).
417	//   - otherwise, if the API base is itself an entire.io host (prod/staging), use
