// RepoKeyFor is the INJECTIVE tenancy key for a repo's brain artifacts. The wire slug
// alone is LOSSY — the client/server safeRepoPathComponent collapses distinct repos
// (e.g. acme/.github and acme/github both render "gh/acme/github") — so keying by slug
// would let two repos with different ACLs share one keyspace, and a member of one could
// read or CAS-advance the other's fact-set. Binding the repo ULID (unique + stable) into
// the key makes it injective: distinct repos never collide, even on a colliding slug.
// The slug is retained as a readable prefix for grouping/debugging.
func RepoKeyFor(slug, repoID string) string {
	return slug + "@" + repoID
}

